{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1495,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d61ecbaf7964943b6d1963b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園に来て、まずもらった衣装が\r\nコレでさ。嬉しくて踊りまくって…\r\n汗のせいで翌日にはクリーニングさ",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b23ccf188f39ff797e15a2615372d56c23c0179c26ee4bf6a05f07f71538c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7877e06de673f2d5bbe51172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お揃いの衣装を着て、同じステージ\r\nで歌い踊る！ライブ中はさ、この\r\n時間よ、ずっと続けって思うんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae36214db865706381573b2c31224d8ac49d3dcd7497bcbcb67faafbc79b7d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1394c39483e5f21687c23f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踊るように生きて、欲しいもの\r\n全部掴む！そんなアタシの生き様を\r\nこの勝負服と共に刻んでやるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccd547f0e18c0ca5938e486d0083b684e7b20b3e12a231ed0ac4802ac80aa2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b61893baab0dbf51f76702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブでもこの衣装はよく映える\r\nんだ！ママの舞台衣装を参考に\r\nしたのさ。ダンサーっぽいだろ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af487a43fde100f33a5c2799e133af4376825e79a2a15dc1eb2c63935d33328",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8b68ae8b1bf618034f7c68d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘリオスはご機嫌な太陽さ！\r\n『おっはよー！』ってひと声で\r\n眠気もヒュンと逃げていくんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7310332f6688891c98cce97047d8b70c9b47c37b15de2a27ea0428f36c89341a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3148cef24172660549d301fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスレッスンの先生とは\r\n個人的にもよく話すんだ。新しい\r\n振付けの感想を聞かれたりするよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f15617b157f1c950d6af3e991c5045a85bf572aaf577fcb08d138ad570707f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec5992541b07fb0b89c3807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニヴァースも夜空を見上げては、\r\n遥か遠くに想いを馳せてるんだと。\r\n…ロマンだよな、わかるぜ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9581911f4eecee77ac6b3f92e70ee6540307e10c139e5167a48e184925a75c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0e293c0f44bcf2d3bf9c3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ついつい料理を作りすぎるんだが、\r\nそういう時は全部弁当にするんだ！\r\nで、花見さ！宴し放題、最高だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b253490a436338ef011988637471a523aaca16cc2ed7fc44431ae3eb87ce4b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a576d0b027dfb32258c2650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつか…氷の城を購入して…\r\n夏はそこで宴を開いてやるんだ…！\r\nこの暑さは…それまでの辛抱…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96511ed765e787a1511b21220d7e52565839c9f975720eaa2eda47035e92dee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:650e65bc02eec3550e5d45d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロブロイと本の話で盛り上がってさ\r\n宝探しの冒険に、英雄と仲間の絆！\r\nアイツが語るロマンに胸が躍ったよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6190a67a4937f57624541cde82dcd965fa1d8028ed74b7ff042efea04aea5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42d152245ef47f2c7424018",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの故郷じゃ、池が凍ったら\r\nみんなで滑りに行くんだ。近所の\r\nチビにも教えてさ…元気かな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81582d16c821073272f17be4c21751d6c699339a73805ff7d59113590b1b7954",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc9a2b4f322645a67ae9b71e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK、準備はできてる！\r\n今日もいいリズムを刻んでやるさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f2b901c54ddf67cbee172ea64cb9843ec3f7bec3c592e45c1636a7f17dea18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bd8b40bdf204798e43153a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ、やるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad35cf98bd75fa3f832aec08bfff509bdb7118639423c77ab04e496903b5d5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccc4e5d89bde9e95c374a97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考える役目はアンタに任せる！\r\nアタシはただ、\r\n全力で思うがまま走るだけだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0692a89ce8b6b07cc2a30887bf6d6dc898eea426410274a12cc79303991dda56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b794f8b4a1c008522434fa30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、今日のトレーニングも\r\n楽しもうじゃないか！ここに2人が\r\n揃ったんだ、いい時間を過ごそうぜ",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b9e29ccb56f64357447454ab6dc11cf49affe65fff23a914d8ef285d268e74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441c632e45dd54ee75c19c86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow、もう走っている奴らがいる\r\nじゃないか！乗り遅れるわけには\r\nいかないぞ、アタシたちも行こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa6571b4585552fcfff7956c63bea6ed77a7ece20a52014e5eda4d2314444a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cbe093fe9940601f81ea2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のアタシはツイているんだ。\r\n自販機のスロット、7が揃ってさ！\r\n1本やるよ、Happyのシェアだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e037fb176793b5df55a8ff33189a679d9c04d4e6afa799be9d78fcb46783291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3ba8c7a799bc99e33fbd243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有名になってさ、スポンサーが\r\nついたらCM依頼とかもくるよな？\r\nそうしたら一緒に出ようぜ！ハハッ",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d686105081c7987f0d3574d7ec150db8a116dce9330b6ad28770f72af3bd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f62c65de5602fc57e2afa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界一の夢が叶ったら、次は何を\r\nしたい？何でも言ってみろよ、\r\nアンタの想像以上を見せてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb40d2a23867f46feda372027588444dea8a62aad5562af746a5737b2a44fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f65e89ed21d9862cf4d204e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "せっかくの合宿だ、もっとヒート\r\nアップしよう！太陽をステージ\r\nライトに、楽しもうじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bf13add9166ac663e968876e535ca2da1808445738685fc9dd13961d35b781",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7675393a64b0093a9938c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからも一生、一緒にバカ騒ぎしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bc38e855f97d5c542fef9c55e98ebbdef7eec302426c4cbc4568e88f8567cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112bdaf615df5de6e810d576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシたちの旅路に…乾杯っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1919dae19ed0e262cb98b797be288056dc91a24ce846465e72c72be3d2157f9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1066d318643231c40adcf9a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ステップに磨きがかかったぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad5b6e100ed41e7736893c3c1d8b4919793d808d478ebbb6d65d1c39bc4eb75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:880061803b909ddef7eff4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと沸かせてやるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4747160de7d508b2e5aae367a0100c74d6091389baae0b8416ed61ccb4e5f63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445e7a73d0221bdbd0249826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK、タップダンスシチーだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ea81825173037a109932257fa73f91ad41753254b46bb1abc982f48afa9a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ca99248a5b729c639eaae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一生終わらない宴で\r\nアンタも笑って暮らそうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac98dfd1f434a9e6ddfb1672eb0b436e958702a54185f05a12ed5f43928265b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5999069af89a01a963d30c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう一肌脱いでやるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c8564667af31e9cf1749201b43b6bf66cde984abf3aa1102f1535ba3af19cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6740da3cb1cabcf19625c47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、リードされたいのは誰だ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a84000f4982cf6fc0e97258d86edc3003263c71e96f9d29d94b26fe6c93eff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f46b6c8e733280e754e405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――行くぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b634c90ec573c26f2178b0dfccba2781e89e83c241b070606c9bb70b37092829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317f53c78383f6e758248574",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強に至る、その日まで。\r\n私が見えていなかった私を、\r\nたくさん教えてほしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "702e6cebea97654df9d1152428af59f0e26182a2502e42010685b92cee460487",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c58d222475b747a1adf615a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97947257c9cc4d99fa74f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ad959e7d38bf0879fa29694e9dfb266be6347e47e6b87a96796c63131331ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11a60ba3c42e7b25eea1ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧とは、呼べなくても――\r\nそれでも進めばいい。\r\n…胸を張っていこうと思う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e0aabd66fb044a1e6101840b3d1410e05b2fcd43ca5ec9cbfd7d40acac3586",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b59fd18a9dd672f3301668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………。\r\n…いや。今も\r\n君がいるなと、思っただけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47091ad4a5d0dc410522ef41ed6aaa3e0f593889a3592102cda88c9e71e0ed2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6f935a6b1f6c93aa70011b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速さに優れた者、技巧に優れた者…\r\n一族に名を連ねる最強の中の最強が\r\n正月に決まる。羽根つき大会でな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c253d8ea06d12c4625a9f57981aa3559b51b384b1416507737c9dae8de91e92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acec417db119ee5b4d80adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコをくれた相手に大豆クッキー\r\nを渡している。豆類のビタミンEも\r\n摂取すると、より効果的なんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b955dc14e58cb3c87b5d0cb5471c5bebb16aaff7f12cd983eeced63923a8b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bcfdcead0de451cb61acd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カカオ70％含有のチョコレートを\r\n用意した。苦味は強いが、\r\n抗酸化作用が高い。…お疲れ様。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e066c915bde15a2704666886330958c413a129d9e03f339b139b993375e1d284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97d13a3f6e5f24b10e09d4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短冊には、毎年一族の健康と\r\n安全を願っている。\r\n…それが叶えば、充分だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "178c0f9ee4c850ac4a3ed28eabe04623071b459a1de931ebddd6f4cd04098aea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82f4b54b6a82590b471dae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もし、霊魂というものが本当に\r\n存在しているのなら…過去の偉大な\r\nウマ娘に、併走を申し込みたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b9ab33562da74be4ae9e6c06e3567ae89b80c132ed8abc8ea86e3183b94a838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692d17dbbaca119017ba4d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスはチートデーと家族で\r\n決めている。ケーキのカロリーは\r\n計算禁止。両親も笑って止めてくる",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9457ce619fb6fb2535be1f0c6f73c9d22435a6236a5723d0e2b6cf90ee9d941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98fa9727d003f82881713c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し、外を歩かないか？…パリの\r\n大通りも煌びやかだと聞いた。\r\n今日はその雰囲気を、味わえそうだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "22987ec65897804d78f1cf9f3b64c79f16bb40e36ec6d146123123c9aa0ac41d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf92984564d7b2f45b3cd3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然の結果だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed9030d352ac29902475233cf3bf00b35e9095723942228160db64eea5f13f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0fb5194f4e7f8cdfe46345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末年始は太りやすいらしいな。\r\n簡単な運動を考えてきた。君の場合\r\n2000キロカロリー消費が目標だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "538e8e8ddf7742441debc2342a77d55984cce6754390a947c15c99992e99ccaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c615a48277994691a6bf7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君、誕生日らしいな。おめでとう。\r\n親戚が運営するジムの招待券を用意\r\nした。トレーナーは私が務めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c787c7c20258e7dd8af06c8716644da0d58927f236a3b99b7d2bae7346ee3a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90032106b99119e5fbf6b7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…正直、誰かに何かをプレゼント\r\nした経験が少なくて困っている。\r\n君は、どうしたら喜んでくれる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50b2678c02514ce9097f8116a10e3dcf43202b2d291419366eebd1872cb37d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2603c8ba73dec958d7f31e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姉たちからプレゼントが届いた。\r\n王冠モチーフの、万年筆と手袋…\r\n相応しい振る舞いを心掛けたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "915a13f601b1dfb4719a1813f63ca71a926e618da262f21874be7a527ac32fb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6e3d4ac43f580458d63160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欲しいもの…君の時間をもらえる\r\nだろうか。今後の式典で着用する\r\n衣装を…揃いで、あつらえたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05bd43b1aa213430b908053258c5154880ae5599031ba26016684a900c1ccfa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7cbf91f6d9f3f6ee7ae63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通知が来ている。\r\n早めに確認したほうがいい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2720d88be105074e1abb6f741b2d0b7c385f410b1b4306ca9ae56e9f7242e77d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7277a0269b76c570bb8d413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君宛てにプレゼントが届いていた。\r\n受け取りを勧める。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86531d254c87d96117d9104fac78c93fa45588cdfc9239fc34845292bd836c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de816d66b158031f3326f240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "達成済みのミッションがある。\r\n自分が成したことは、正確に\r\n把握しておくべきだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e44a636023b7d01b4a0418fb6abc88b15f8f25a561e7b415c694db96935f9879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c89b2c7aba30d31ae21230",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントがあるらしい。\r\n参加を視野に入れてもいいと思う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da4b8ed54d1acf24fe549b155381160bf3e44f534ddc914178c34e5627e165a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a578bf6096d8d6d92e37a608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが開催中だ。\r\n催し物に、顔を出しておくのも\r\nいいだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d7a8251404fdd2ac2034261d5c18b4f7851253e1765bfdeeded4939f90e24c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2470f3a47268eee7301acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…反省を活かそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a22bab97b18b739c98f5895670fee596ed743b29977fadbb9724d97d2e73ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc1560ebf46304575c8c9f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑レベルが上がったようだ。\r\n成果は正しく把握しておくといい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "447703424d116c64019452f4eab3d4423199a67b5c45bcad34d2e79e4bfea7b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f67c5dba196671abb121c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的私服多是运动品牌的，因为弹性\n和速干性都很好，可以直接进行\n一些简单的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cf81061ca7f01b4066f5ddd687a24548d8fa91e7d89190b029b9caf929891a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70f18eab65100368518af84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么时候、在任何情况下，\n我都不会失去仪态。我一直注意\n让自己在别人眼中也无可羞愧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90383046fbfafe6bc6e85a24018f63fff773dc1e369f7cbf4b44e5d5a73becbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb429ac61a00f98d509d73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽姐曾经教过我化妆……  \n在她帮我上红色眼影的时候，\n我非常紧张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9114e8b2d9e14d34d5590626308ac0e6f8752a61a800b930e60523adc6633e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41e5d48a2c37438e2e25da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力は対等、か――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a222d4d635cb0f2a1a4dd2e79e143d486173bdc4cb102e7d12a98709c02e3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f746f721fa34ad355145035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強なればこそ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85974c8e854c4f17a15134a98379aa71fbeee371e4403060fc75e739310b96d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f56e037b1985f66ebc4088e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…反省を活かそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a22bab97b18b739c98f5895670fee596ed743b29977fadbb9724d97d2e73ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c392f3971d49dce4f5fd93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力は対等、か――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a222d4d635cb0f2a1a4dd2e79e143d486173bdc4cb102e7d12a98709c02e3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20eb7eda6111a45895b59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハイスコア更新だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ba41f77e2b787d43d888deda02a6d5c8e50e07f6c7cd6ad37f74f532df02ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35d4726f81713ef8191f0095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しく、征こう――",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d51d4ddbc95c05d3227745afb64c7ab7940119e9253d5d9a759a881dbf93cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d2fa40a584400f65f9764f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4a92dcb582f2dfde4c8841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングか？\r\nよし、入念に準備をしておこう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c08eac5bf835195b3a49e5d8a24d7658f29468b0d668811f249ab1f8a53d4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58618fcdad115702c9bc9d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "過去の栄光、物語――\r\n引き継ぐに相応しい己でありたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "957918951e0bc9c46853d96275db8e9048bf17856aa05b18233e013b323ec6b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e10e74b94c22727d535787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースにエントリーするのか。\r\n日頃の鍛錬の成果を――試そう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65d3935b5b38754145b28f3c832ff42cbf7b1922577833c90897490a8b80b3ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cec94ff4a8f4ad354564c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強の――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e175c6025c36ef4f67c0e9ba657c04bf25ccdf2b2e2ab6c189d779a21bb7aaf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c3e73587ff18c2604a0430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“女帝”と共に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95d4ada118456039ba8fc07c378b29876a7efeb83a320b6d0017b310aad6eda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95a86c91e6bf45b5de02d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccae1722eb3d2fa59922debf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが、受け継いだ力――",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c0cadba076f7aefb2a12f2eb3725338d279fd1f86f2356466f19482aa5600c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ca6c5bddb2549ff5275160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のログインボーナスだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dba575b73ae65f4bf703fdd1c5ec13b60094a78307e1abf7bab07a9763646d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174017ea6c9d53549b07e48f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a91c3a42bee3b610a977d9d276cc865eacf6a6007436b210196e4495453836d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfab802454aa20857976c2ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "102be444c7c1e00b22b7731dfa734b449c0115aff69d08289378634098da8a4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03350cc85e13b1c4c0c77217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f88e8667b5428f6650014985f14474d392d3bf501571ccf4b5af28f81a72a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852d4b1af970d3ea014a557b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんなに…！いい集中力だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c6bb7d76b075db6dba4f66e600b898cd4e38529f8aa3ed0d242bbdad18b754",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f27917c2ba06d6238f1efa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…可愛いものだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad8346209bd53452a3706be51493f81dd1f8256329ce1777fae5c2e7113d5b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f0936f841fc45e73186b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…次に活かそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "102fb2cb303642f9ba54de22590c4f2633e1c30da2075d11024347b5127c3a41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a922567d9bc413fd256196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんなに…！いい集中力だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c6bb7d76b075db6dba4f66e600b898cd4e38529f8aa3ed0d242bbdad18b754",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:923f6ded15891544b437b7bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…可愛いものだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad8346209bd53452a3706be51493f81dd1f8256329ce1777fae5c2e7113d5b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
